body:
I can confirm this is a bug with the following test in `io.quarkus.resteasy.reactive.server.test.simple.SeparatorQueryParamTest`: 


```java
    @Test
    public void multipleQueryParamBean() {
        get("/hello/bean?name=foo,bar&name=one,two,three&name=yolo")
                .then()
                .statusCode(200)
                .body(is("hello foo bar one two three yolo"))
                .header("x-size", "6");
    }
```
